sequenceDiagram
  actor P as Writer or Producer
  participant C as NarrationToolsController
  participant S as NarrationToolsService
  participant R as RenderServiceClient
  participant K as Render worker
  participant X as Script or Composition service
  P->>C: POST /scripts/{id}/sync-durations (baseRevision)
  C->>S: syncDurations(id, baseRevision, user)
  S->>S: Role check, snapshot measuredRevision
  alt baseRevision stale
    S-->>C: 409 STALE_REVISION, no TTS spent
  else current
    S->>R: syncDurations(scenes, fps), timeout 180 s
    R->>K: POST /sync-durations
    K->>K: TTS per scene, Whisper word timings
    K-->>R: durationInFrames, captionWords
    S->>X: apply(frames, measuredRevision)
    X->>X: Lock row, compare revision
    alt edited while measuring
      X-->>S: 409 STALE_REVISION, nothing written
    else unchanged
      X-->>S: Saved, revision + 1
      S-->>C: SyncDurationsResponse(target, revision)
    end
  end
